title: "Single-Cell Transcriptomic Characterization of Tumor
Immune States and an Immune State Index in HNSCC"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-23"
url: "https://github.com/raja016956/hnscc-single-cell-isi"
repository-code: "https://github.com/raja016956/hnscc-single-cell-isi"
keywords:
  - "single-cell-rna-seq"
  - "tumor-microenvironment"
  - "immune-modeling"
  - "hnscc"
  - "immune-state-index"
abstract: >-
  A computational single-cell RNA-seq repository designed for 
  transcriptomic analysis, visualization, and modeling of immune cell states 
  and the evaluation of an exploratory Immune State Index (ISI) in 
  head and neck squamous cell carcinoma.
